## 2. The business problem

The fraud team can review only {{ k }} transactions a day. With rare fraud, a model that flags nothing scores high accuracy, and ROC-AUC weighs thresholds that no team could ever work. The measures that matter are how much fraud money the {{ k }} daily alerts catch and what the reviews cost.

